So Perfect Weather was the first weather app I did, but it was like 2010, 2011.

77
00:05:55,680 --> 00:06:05,200
So I've been building weather apps for over a decade now and then launched a whole brand new SKU, new app as Weather Atlas in 2017 ish.

78
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:09,120
And then Weather Atlas got rebranded as Weather Up.

79
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,600
Was Weather Atlas basically a rebrand then?

80
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,640
You said it was a new SKU.

