I've had this weird mix of working with contractors that I pay and then some combination of pay and do a rev share.

87
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:40,480
I started doing the partnership thing back in 2010, 2011, after two projects went sideways.

88
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,960
So each of those projects, I lost fifty grand.

89
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,960
So I was working with developers.

90
