00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:24,240
I do think it's a legacy of Box Software, really though.

213
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:32,720
The mindset and it did work before subscriptions when especially paid upfront apps, it works really well.

214
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:38,800
Like launching a pro would get massive spikes in revenue where you'd make like 60 K in a week.

