00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,600
They know how to control the narrative.

244
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:58,880
They know how, you know what I mean?

245
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,040
And they are doing paid updates though.

246
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:05,680
That's the thing, is like, a lot of their launches are convincing you to get a new iPhone.

247
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:08,480
And so it's like, save it up, save it up, save it up, and then do it again.

