00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:24,160
People in the press were literally begging, please send me your interactive widgets.

321
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:24,720
Yeah, I need some.

322
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:25,200
I needed something.

323
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:26,000
They needed it.

324
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:29,040
And I don't want to just copy Apple's press release, right?

325
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:29,520
Right.

326
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:34,000
You had to pitch them on it in was this January when you were starting to kind of reach out?

