00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:34,240
Yeah.

328
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:34,640
Yeah.

329
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:45,440
So like, not only did you need it to be compelling in its own right as a story that they already want to write, but you had to make them want to write it well after the readers are demanding this anyway.

