347
00:24:50,320 --> 00:24:54,480
And then even like 9 to 5 Mac was like, Hey, I think we should just wait till tomorrow.

348
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:56,720
They didn't even publish till the next day.

349
00:24:57,120 --> 00:25:02,800
