00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:17,680
Two, there wasn't any kind of social halo because the air was sucked out of the room.

353
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:22,560
So people who may have seen it and may have otherwise tweeted about it or said, Hey, this is cool.

