And there's sometimes a little bit you can do to, like, derisk that.

395
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:44,400
Maybe you have a friendly contact in the press that tells you, hey, there's already an embargo news drop that day.

396
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:46,000
But like, you're not usually that lucky.

397
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:52,320
But if you're launching more often, you have a little more even., you know, you de-risk your launch plans by having many small launches.

