00:43:41,200 --> 00:43:41,920
Well, how did that stuff go?

599
00:43:42,080 --> 00:43:45,040
Because like, that's probably more than most folks do on a launch, but I'm curious.

600
00:43:45,200 --> 00:43:45,680
What did you set up?

601
00:43:45,840 --> 00:43:46,240
What did you use?

602
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:47,040
And like, how did that go?

603
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:47,360
Yeah.

